ry', 'Master Biomancer', 'Master of Cruelties', 'Mathas, Fiend Seeker', "Mayael's Aria", 'Mentor of the Meek', 'Might of Old Krosa', 'Mikaeus, the Lunarch', 'Militia Bugler', 'Mindwrack Liege', 'Mistfire Adept', 'Mistmeadow Witch', 'Mizzix of the Izmagnus', 'Momentary Blink', 'Monastery Mentor', 'Monastery Swiftspear', 'Muldrotha, the Gravetide', 'Mulldrifter', 'Murkfiend Liege', 'Myth Realized', 'Necrotic Ooze', 'Nephalia Smuggler', 'Nicol Bolas, God-Pharaoh', 'Nim Deathmantle', 'Ob Nixilis, Unshackled', "Oona's Prowler", 'Oracle of Mul Daya', 'Orzhov Basilica', 'Orzhov Pontiff', 'Panharmonicon', 'Path to Exile', 'Phyrexian Altar', 'Phyrexian Tyranny', 'Pillar of the Paruns', "Pirate's Pillage", 'Pithing Needle', 'Planar Bridge', 'Privileged Position', 'Prized Amalgam', 'Prophetic Bolt', 'Psychic Symbiont', 'Pull from Tomorrow', "Purphoros's Emissary", 'Qasali Pridemage', 'Rafiq of the Many', 'Rakdos Carnarium', 'Rampant Growth', 'Rancor', 'Relief Captain', 'Restoration Angel', 'Reveillark', 'Rift Bolt', 'Rishkar, Peema Renegade', 'River Hoopoe', 'Roon of the Hidden Realm', 'Ruric Thar, the Unbowed', 'Scab-Clan Giant', 'Scale Blessing', 'Scion of Darkness', 'Seasoned Pyromancer', 'Sedraxis Specter', 'Sedris, the Traitor King', 'Seeker of the Way', "Seekers' Squire", 'Selesnya Sanctuary', "Sensei's Divining Top", 'Sensor Splicer', 'Settle Beyond Reality', 'Severed Strands', 'Shadowborn Apostle', 'Shattergang Brothers', 'Sidisi, Brood Tyrant', 'Simic Growth Chamber', 'Skeleton Archer', 'Skinrender', 'Skullbriar, the Walking Grave', 'Smothering Tithe', "Sparkmage's Gambit", 'Spell Pierce', 'Spider Spawning', 'Splinterfright', 'Sprouting Thrinax', 'Staggershock', 'Storm Fleet Pyromancer', 'Strands of Undeath', 'Sultai Soothsayer', 'Summer Bloom', 'Supernatural Stamina', 'Supreme Verdict', 'Surgical Extraction', 'Surreal Memoir', 'Talrand, Sky Summoner', 'Tariel, Reckoner of Souls', "Teferi's Protection", 'Teneb, the Harvester', 'Tenth District Legionnaire', 'Terminate'